# Catalogue

## Contact sheet (signature)

- First thing on `/`: every specimen live at reduced scale in a tight grid
- No headline card, no gradient, no stats — two lines of copy beneath the sheet
- Everything around it stays grey so the sheet lands
- Content is near full-bleed (`--content-max: none`); `--plate-min` / `--sheet-min` densify above `90rem` / `120rem`
- Filters sync to the URL (`?kind=&q=`…); sticky filter bar + skip link; result count + clear
- Contact sheet cells lazy-mount via IntersectionObserver (`useFrameVisibility` starts `false`, sync-checks above-fold, then observes with ~`50%` rootMargin) and link to `/s/:id`
- Placeholders and `PreviewFrame` reserve the specimen aspect-ratio; frame scale uses CSS `cqw`/`cqi` (no post-paint JS resize)
- Previews call `resolvePayload` only when visible — HTML/CSS/JS chunks are not in the initial catalogue graph

## Plates

Anatomy: mono ref (left) + origin (right) → framed preview → display title → mono **facets** → optional **inspiration** (`Persona · Persona 5`) → optional free tags → `[Copy prompt]` + `[Open →]` + `[Playground →]`.

- Primary copy action only on plates; detail route shows Full / Code / Contract
- `Playground →` forks via `/playground?fork=<id>` (same seed as detail “Open in playground”)
- Mount frames with `IntersectionObserver` (same hook as the sheet; start not-visible, sync above-fold); unmount when outside the expanded margin
- Build copy prompts lazily on click (`CopyButton getText`) — never on every plate render

## Filters

Catalogue plate list filters by required facets (AND) plus optional Inspiration franchise / Title chips, plus text search. Contact sheet stays unfiltered. Taxonomy: `35_taxonomy` / `taxonomy.ts` / `inspiration.ts`.

## Detail `/s/:id`

- Sticky preview + ControlStrip | tabs Spec / Markup / Styles / Contract / Prompt
- Real `role="tablist"` with arrow-key navigation
- Unknown id: empty state linking back to the catalogue with a next step
